{"result":{"acceptance_year":2007,"advert_code":"26233","advert_description":"Nov\u011b uvoln\u011bno! \u010cerstv\u011b vymalov\u00e1no.\r\n\t\u200c\r\nNab\u00edz\u00edme k pron\u00e1jmu kr\u00e1sn\u00fd, skv\u011ble dispozi\u010dn\u011b vy\u0159e\u0161en\u00fd a sv\u011btl\u00fd byt v n\u00edzkopodla\u017en\u00ed (4 patra) novostavb\u011b v Praze 5 \u2013 Ko\u0161\u00ed\u0159e, ul. Lov\u010densk\u00e1. \r\n\t\u200c\r\nLuxusn\u00ed lokalita!\r\n\t\u200c\r\nAbsolutn\u00ed klid, mno\u017estv\u00ed zelen\u011b a v\u00fdborn\u00e1 dostupnost MHD (7 minut tramvaj\u00ed nebo 6 minut autobusem na |M| And\u011bl, 18 minut na |M| N\u00e1m\u011bst\u00ed M\u00edru).\r\n\t\u200c\r\n300 m od domu P\u0159\u00edrodn\u00ed park Ko\u0161\u00ed\u0159e-Motol a pouh\u00fd 1 km od domu rozs\u00e1hl\u00fd lesopark Na Cibulk\u00e1ch.\r\n\t\u200c\r\nByt 2+kk (55,5 m2), zd\u011bn\u00fd sklep (3,2 m2). 2x WC!\r\n \r\nZv\u00fd\u0161en\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edzem\u00ed (parapety 250 cm nad \u00farovn\u00ed). Mo\u017enost gar\u00e1\u017eov\u00e9ho st\u00e1n\u00ed + 1.500,-K\u010d/m\u011bs. Uzav\u0159en\u00fd vnitroblok s parkovou \u00fapravou a lavi\u010dkami pouze pro rezidenty.\r\n\t\u200c\r\n\u0160atn\u00ed sk\u0159\u00ed\u0148 v p\u0159eds\u00edni. Kuchy\u0148sk\u00e1 linka s vestav\u011bnou varnou deskou, horkovzdu\u0161nou troubou, my\u010dkou, lednic\u00ed s mraz\u00e1kem a digesto\u0159\u00ed s odtahem. \r\n\t\u200c\r\nVelk\u00e1 d\u0159ev\u011bn\u00e1 eurookna s p\u0159edokenn\u00edmi roletami! Orientace oken na z\u00e1pad. Velmi prostorn\u00e1 koupelna s vanou, WC a p\u0159\u00edpravou na pra\u010dku se vstupem z lo\u017enice a druh\u00e9 samostatn\u00e9 WC s umyvadlem se vstupem z p\u0159eds\u00edn\u011b. \r\n\t\u200c\r\nNa podlah\u00e1ch dla\u017eba a plovouc\u00ed. Vyt\u00e1p\u011bn\u00ed centr\u00e1ln\u00edm kotlem v dom\u011b s m\u011b\u0159i\u010di vstupn\u00edho tepla. Stropy vysok\u00e9 261 cm. \r\n\t\u200c\r\nSpole\u010dn\u00fd prostor (ko\u010d\u00e1rk\u00e1rna x kol\u00e1rna). \r\n\t\u200c\r\nInternet (2 Gb/s) a kabelov\u00e1 televize zavedeny do bytu. Bezpe\u010dnostn\u00ed dve\u0159e. \r\n\t\u200c\r\nKr\u00e1sn\u00e9 okol\u00ed s plnou ob\u010danskou vybavenost\u00ed a sportovn\u00edho vy\u017eit\u00ed. Sportovn\u00ed hala, fotbalov\u00e9 h\u0159i\u0161t\u011b, Z\u0160, M\u0160, gymn\u00e1zium, l\u00e9ka\u0159sk\u00e9 centrum V\u00e1clavka, obchody, restaurace, kav\u00e1rny, tramvajov\u00e1 a autobusov\u00e1 zast\u00e1vka, v\u0161e v okruhu 500 m.\r\n\t\u200c\r\nV\u00edce fotografi\u00ed (37) na str\u00e1nk\u00e1ch blanikreality pod ID: 26233.\r\n\t\u200c\r\nK nast\u011bhov\u00e1n\u00ed ihned. \r\n\t\u200c\r\nCena 24.900,-K\u010d + slu\u017eby 3.200,-K\u010d + elekt\u0159ina cca 1.000,-K\u010d. Gar\u00e1\u017eov\u00e9 st\u00e1n\u00ed + 1.500,-K\u010d/m\u011bs. Kauce 29.000,-K\u010d, provize pro RK 24.900,-K\u010d + 21% DPH. \r\n\t\u200c\r\nT\u0159\u00edda energetick\u00e9 n\u00e1ro\u010dnosti (PENB) - C - \u00fasporn\u00e1.\r\n","advert_images":[{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1067,"id":1017363263,"kind":2,"order":1,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeCsx6aBLFJIKQwyZ/827a.jpeg","width":1600},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1200,"id":1017363266,"kind":2,"order":4,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUBL8BsBLABIKQwy1/99af.jpeg","width":1600},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1200,"id":1017363269,"kind":2,"order":5,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUB6IMDBLr4IKQwzY/3aba.jpeg","width":1600},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1067,"id":1017363272,"kind":2,"order":6,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeD7yCdBo8oIKQwzy/10d1.jpeg","width":1600},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1067,"id":1017363275,"kind":2,"order":7,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeD7yCdBdioIKQw0O/6bd1.jpeg","width":1600},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1067,"id":1017363278,"kind":2,"order":8,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEeCsx6aBLEuIKQw0n/99a9.jpeg","width":1600},{"ai_edited":fal